 {
  "cluster_id": "c2",
  "summary": "Head-path variant of the same premature-close root cause: querier.Close() also closes the read's isolationState, unregistering it from Head.iso.readsOpen, so a concurrent head truncation/GC can advance past a still-iterating read \u2014 breaking snapshot isolation (mid-stream ErrNotFound, or results mixing pre- and post-truncation state), distinct from the mmap use-after-free consequence.",
